GAP-*.md
PARMANA-*.md
*test-keys*
*secret*
# Un-ignore legitimate source/test files whose path only contains the
# word "secret(s)" because they implement or test secrets management
# itself (ADR-0009) -- never actual secret material. Without this, an
# entire feature directory silently vanishes from git the moment its
# name matches *secret*, which already happened once
# (docs/adr/ADR-0009-...) before this negation was added.
!packages/*/src/**/*[Ss]ecret*
!packages/*/tests/**/*[Ss]ecret*
!docs/**/*[Ss]ecret*
